  "aside_short_words_mislead": "Aside, and it is the reason the search was abandoned for a proof: all 6 pure PAIRWISE products have indeterminacy 1, so mu-bar is vacuous on every one of them, and the radius-5 ball's 100 Brunnian elements all give 0. Read alone, that sample says the escape stands. It is a fact about short words, not about the image.",
